{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Behold.</b> The sense concerns Hezekiah and his princes, that his kingdom will endure." "As for the one who reads with a lammed <b>ולשרים</b> (\"and to princes\"), I do not know his reason. Similarly: והשלישי לאבשלום (2 Chronicles 3:2); למן היום (Exodus 9:18)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:16.278909522Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}